  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;be the set containing all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrices with entries from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. The total number of matrices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;such that the sum of all the diagonal elements of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;is ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5376",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that the sum of all the diagonal elements of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>, means sum of all diagonal elements is equal to sum of square each element of the matrix.</p><p>i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now sum to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;exactly three of them should be&nbsp;zero and rest should be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>So, total number&nbsp;of possible matrices&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5376</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}